          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पणिहारी (paṇihārī) is built on a reconstructed pānīyahāra, \"a water-carrier\", from the word behind पाणी and a word for carrying; CDIAL lists Old Marwari pāṇiyārī (CDIAL 8088)."
